<view class="screen"><view class="topbar"><view><text class="brand">小帐同学</text><text class="subbrand">记好每一笔，遇见更好的自己</text></view><view class="top-icons">⌕　♧</view></view><view class="hero"><view><text class="greeting">早上好！👋</text><text class="hello">今天也要好好记账哦～</text></view><image class="mascot" src="/assets/mascot-avatar.png" mode="aspectFill"/></view><view class="summary card"><view class="summary-title"><text>本月收支　›</text><text class="month">{{month}}</text></view><view class="metrics"><view><text>支出</text><text class="metric-value">¥ {{expense}}</text><text class="down">较上月 ↓ 12%</text></view><view><text>收入</text><text class="metric-value">¥ {{income}}</text><text class="up">较上月 ↑ 8%</text></view><view><text>结余</text><text class="metric-value">¥ {{balance}}</text><text class="muted">收支平衡 65%</text></view></view><view class="budget-row"><text class="budget-icon">▣</text><text>月度预算　<b>¥ 3,000.00</b></text><text class="budget-used">已使用 79%　›</text></view><view class="progress"><view style="width:79%"></view></view></view><view class="actions"><button class="primary" bindtap="add">＋<text>记一笔</text></button><view bindtap="add"><text class="action-icon yellow">ϟ</text><text>快速记账</text></view><view bindtap="add"><text class="action-icon purple">AI</text><text>AI记账</text></view><view bindtap="add"><text class="action-icon blue">▣</text><text>拍照记账</text></view><view bindtap="add"><text class="action-icon red">♩</text><text>语音记账</text></view></view><view class="trend card"><view class="section-head"><view><text>本月消费趋势</text><text class="down block">较上月 ↓ 12%</text></view><view class="switch"><text>周</text><text class="selected">月</text><text>年</text></view></view><view class="chart"><view wx:for="{{bars}}" wx:key="*this" style="height:{{item}}%"></view></view><view class="dates"><text>9.1</text><text>9.5</text><text>9.10</text><text>9.15</text><text>9.20</text><text>9.25</text><text>9.30</text></view></view><view class="spent card"><view class="section-head"><text>钱花哪了</text><text class="muted">›</text></view><view class="category-row"><view wx:for="{{categories}}" wx:key="name"><text class="cat-icon {{item.color}}">{{item.icon}}</text><text>{{item.name}}</text><text>¥ {{item.amount}}</text><text class="muted">{{item.percent}}%</text></view></view></view><view class="section-head recent-title"><text>最近账单</text><text class="muted" bindtap="viewAll">查看全部　›</text></view><view wx:for="{{records}}" wx:key="id" class="record" bindlongpress="remove" data-id="{{item.id}}"><text class="record-icon">{{item.icon||'🍜'}}</text><view class="record-main"><text>{{item.title||item.category}}</text><text class="note">{{item.date}} {{item.time}}　· 微信支付</text></view><text class="record-amount {{item.type}}">{{item.type==='income'?'＋':'－'}} ¥ {{item.amount}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{!records.length}}" class="empty">还没有账单，点击下方按钮记一笔</view><view class="insight"><image src="/assets/mascot-avatar.png"/><view><b>小账同学发现</b><text>你这个月餐饮支出比上月同期多了 ¥126，建议适当控制外食。</text></view><text>›</text></view><button class="float-add" bindtap="add">＋</button></view>
